{"product_id":"nasty-super-cool-guava-ice-salt","title":"Nasty Super Cool - Guava Ice Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eGuava Ice Salt – Nasty Super Cool, Guava ice blends juicy ripe Guavas with a blast of icy menthol for a crisp, refreshing rush.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNASTY Juice Super Cool series is engineered frost—not just typical menthol or mint. Each flavour delivers a signature chill that enhances without muting bold, juicy top notes. Designed for full-intensity coolness. it provides a crisp, clean sensation that refreshes the palate without overpowering, ensuring flavour hits cold and clean every time..\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 35MG \u0026amp; 50MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: Nicotine Salt E-liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG Ratio: 50\/50 – Best for pod devices\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: Nasty Juice\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrigin: Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":42006259204151,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Guava Ice - 35 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42006259236919,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Guava Ice - 50 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Guava-Ice_1024x1024_2x_6cd48230-d004-4f3b-93b1-ffc7e5acbf4f.webp?v=1764627974","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-super-cool-guava-ice-salt","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




